{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-algebra-solving","title":"线性代数与求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/numerics/linear-algebra-solving","wordCount":1179,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"线性代数与求解\">线性代数与求解</h1><p>如果只能用一个符号概括 MATLAB，那就是反斜杠 <code>\\</code>。<code>x = A\\b</code> 解线性方程组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ax = b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>——但这一个字符背后，是 MATLAB 替你分析矩阵结构、在 LU、Cholesky、QR 等算法间自动选择、再调用 LAPACK 多线程例程的一整套智能。理解 <code>\\</code> 不是&quot;除法的反向&quot;，而是&quot;一个会自己挑算法的求解器&quot;，是用好 MATLAB 数值核心的关键。这一篇讲线性代数求解的全貌：直接求解、矩阵分解、特征问题、稀疏矩阵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-反斜杠的算法分诊\">核心概念：反斜杠的算法分诊</h2><p><code>A\\b</code> 之所以强，在于它先看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 长什么样，再决定怎么解。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是方阵且对称正定，走 Cholesky；若一般方阵，走带部分主元的 LU；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是上/下三角，直接回代；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 不是方阵（超定/欠定），走 QR 解最小二乘。整个分诊对你透明——你只写 <code>\\</code>，MATLAB 选最稳最快的路。这与新手常犯的 <code>inv(A)*b</code> 形成鲜明对比：显式求逆既慢又数值不稳，几乎从不该用，求解永远优先 <code>\\</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;A \\ b 求解 Ax=b&quot;] --&gt; B{A 的结构?}&#10;    B --&gt;|三角| C[前/回代&lt;br/&gt;O n^2]&#10;    B --&gt;|对称正定| D[Cholesky 分解]&#10;    B --&gt;|一般方阵| E[部分主元 LU 分解]&#10;    B --&gt;|非方阵 超定| F[QR 最小二乘]&#10;    B --&gt;|稀疏| G[稀疏求解器&lt;br/&gt;UMFPACK/CHOLMOD]&#10;    C --&gt; H[调用 LAPACK 多线程例程]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[\"A \\ b 求解 Ax=b\"] --&gt; B{A 的结构?}\n    B --&gt;|三角| C[前/回代&lt;br/&gt;O n^2]\n    B --&gt;|对称正定| D[Cholesky 分解]\n    B --&gt;|一般方阵| E[部分主元 LU 分解]\n    B --&gt;|非方阵 超定| F[QR 最小二乘]\n    B --&gt;|稀疏| G[稀疏求解器&lt;br/&gt;UMFPACK/CHOLMOD]\n    C --&gt; H[调用 LAPACK 多线程例程]\n    D --&gt; H\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H</pre><p>下表把核心运算与函数对应起来，是日常查阅的索引：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>函数/运算符</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ax=b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><code>A \\ b</code></td>\n<td>永远优于 <code>inv(A)*b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LU 分解</td>\n<td><code>[L,U,P] = lu(A)</code></td>\n<td>一般方阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cholesky</td>\n<td><code>R = chol(A)</code></td>\n<td>对称正定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QR 分解</td>\n<td><code>[Q,R] = qr(A)</code></td>\n<td>最小二乘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征值/向量</td>\n<td><code>[V,D] = eig(A)</code></td>\n<td>见下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奇异值分解</td>\n<td><code>[U,S,V] = svd(A)</code></td>\n<td>降维/秩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行列式/秩</td>\n<td><code>det(A)</code> / <code>rank(A)</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意反斜杠远比&quot;乘以逆&quot;稳，且同一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 多次求解时应复用分解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"matlab\" data-code=\"A = [4 1; 1 3]; b = [1; 2];&#10;x = A \\ b;                         % 求解，自动选 Cholesky/LU/QR&#10;norm(A*x - b)                      % 残差，应接近机器精度 eps&#10;&#10;dA = decomposition(A);             % 分解一次……&#10;x1 = dA \\ b; x2 = dA \\ [3; 4];     % ……求解多次，避免重复 O(n^3) 消元&#10;&#10;S = sparse([1 1 2], [1 2 1], [1 1 1]);   % 只存非零元的稀疏矩阵&#10;spy(S)                                    % 可视化稀疏结构\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>A = [4 1; 1 3]; b = [1; 2];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = A \\ b;                         % 求解，自动选 Cholesky/LU/QR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>norm(A*x - b)                      % 残差，应接近机器精度 eps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dA = decomposition(A);             % 分解一次……</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x1 = dA \\ b; x2 = dA \\ [3; 4];     % ……求解多次，避免重复 O(n^3) 消元</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = sparse([1 1 2], [1 2 1], [1 1 1]);   % 只存非零元的稀疏矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spy(S)                                    % 可视化稀疏结构</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"矩阵分解-稳定求解的基石\">矩阵分解：稳定求解的基石</h2><p>直接的 <code>\\</code> 适合一次性求解，但当你要用**同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 解很多个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>**，应该先做一次分解、复用因子，避免重复消元。<code>[L,U,P] = lu(A)</code> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PA = LU</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">LU</span></span></span></span></span> 拆成三角因子，之后每个新的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 只需两次三角回代，复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。对称正定矩阵用 <code>chol</code> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = R^\\top R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，更快更省。<code>qr</code> 用于最小二乘与正交化。R2017b 起 MATLAB 提供了 <code>decomposition</code> 对象，把这种&quot;分解一次、求解多次&quot;的模式封装得更优雅：<code>dA = decomposition(A); x1 = dA\\b1; x2 = dA\\b2</code>。这些分解的数值稳定性与矩阵的**条件数** <code>cond(A)</code> 直接相关——条件数大意味着病态，结果对输入扰动敏感，这与 <a href=\"../language/data-types-arrays\">数据类型与数组</a> 里讲的浮点精度在此处汇合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特征值与奇异值\">特征值与奇异值</h2><p><code>eig</code> 与 <code>svd</code> 是 MATLAB 处理&quot;矩阵的内在结构&quot;的两大工具，应用极广。<code>[V,D] = eig(A)</code> 解特征问题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Av = \\lambda v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，返回特征向量矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 与对角的特征值矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>——在振动模态、主成分、稳定性分析、马尔可夫稳态里反复出现。<code>[U,S,V] = svd(A)</code> 做奇异值分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = U\\Sigma V^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，是数值上最稳健的工具之一，用于求秩、求伪逆 <code>pinv</code>、低秩近似（图像压缩、推荐系统、PCA 的数值实现）、解病态最小二乘。一个实用判据：当 <code>\\</code> 因病态给出不可靠结果时，转向 SVD 截断小奇异值往往更稳。理解这两个分解，比记住任何工具箱函数都更能让你看懂数值算法的内部。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏矩阵-大规模问题的命脉\">稀疏矩阵：大规模问题的命脉</h2><p>真实工程里的大矩阵往往是稀疏的——有限元刚度矩阵、图的邻接矩阵、网络拉普拉斯算子，绝大多数元素是零。MATLAB 用 <code>sparse</code> 把这类矩阵按压缩列存储（CSC），只存非零元，内存与计算量都按非零数而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 算。神奇之处在于：<code>\\</code>、<code>lu</code>、<code>chol</code>、<code>eigs</code> 等运算对稀疏矩阵会自动切换到专门的稀疏算法（UMFPACK、CHOLMOD、ARPACK），你的代码几乎不用改——<code>A\\b</code> 对稠密和稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 都对，只是底层走不同的路。求少数几个特征值用 <code>eigs</code> 而非 <code>eig</code>（后者对稀疏矩阵会强制稠密化、爆内存）。稀疏支持让 MATLAB 能解百万维的线性系统，是它在科学与工程计算里立足的硬实力，也是它向量化优势（见 <a href=\"../language/vectorization\">向量化</a>）的延伸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>反斜杠 <code>\\</code> 是会自动按矩阵结构分诊算法的求解器，永远优于 <code>inv(A)*b</code></li>\n<li>同一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 多次求解时，先分解（<code>lu</code>/<code>chol</code>/<code>qr</code> 或 <code>decomposition</code> 对象）再复用因子</li>\n<li>数值稳定性看条件数 <code>cond(A)</code>，病态问题对扰动敏感</li>\n<li><code>eig</code> 解特征问题、<code>svd</code> 做奇异值分解，是看懂矩阵内在结构与降维的两大工具</li>\n<li><code>sparse</code> 让大规模稀疏问题按非零元计算，<code>\\</code>/<code>eigs</code> 等自动切换稀疏算法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>求解为何这么快的语言根源：<a href=\"../language/vectorization\">向量化</a></li>\n<li>浮点精度与条件数的来由：<a href=\"../language/data-types-arrays\">数据类型与数组</a></li>\n<li>把解出来的结果画成图：<a href=\"plotting-visualization\">绘图与可视化</a></li>\n<li>跨库：底层数值内核的语言 <a href=\"../../fortran-scientific/arrays-numerics/array-operations\">Fortran 科学计算·数组运算</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>求解器算法分诊、<code>decomposition</code> 对象事实来源：MathWorks 文档 mldivide / decomposition（mathworks.com/help/matlab）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线性代数与求解","id":"线性代数与求解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：反斜杠的算法分诊","id":"核心概念-反斜杠的算法分诊"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵分解：稳定求解的基石","id":"矩阵分解-稳定求解的基石"},{"level":2,"text":"特征值与奇异值","id":"特征值与奇异值"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏矩阵：大规模问题的命脉","id":"稀疏矩阵-大规模问题的命脉"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"数据类型与数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/language/data-types-arrays"},"next":{"title":"微分方程与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/numerics/ode-optimization"}}